IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `arc-rules`

-- Asbestos-related Claims (Management of Commonwealth Liabilities) Act 2005
-- (Cth) — the encoder's tests.

§ `Tests`

`open` MEANS `the breach of duty, not yet settled or finally decided`
`authority` MEANS `a Commonwealth authority at the time of the breach`

GIVEN cond IS A `Condition`, who IS A `Who breached the duty`, src IS A `Source of liability`, ag IS A `Claim made against`, d IS A DATE, back IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Asbestos case`
`with` cond `by` who `under` src `claiming against` ag `on` d `transferred back` back MEANS
    `Asbestos case` OF cond, who, src, ag, d, back

#ASSERT `it is an asbestos-related claim` (`with` `mesothelioma` `by` `the Commonwealth` `under` `open` `claiming against` `no one yet` `on` (Date 1 1 2026) `transferred back` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`it is an asbestos-related claim` (`with` `a condition not caused by asbestos` `by` `the Commonwealth` `under` `open` `claiming against` `no one yet` `on` (Date 1 1 2026) `transferred back` FALSE))
#ASSERT NOT (`it is an asbestos-related claim` (`with` `asbestosis` `by` `Comcare, Australia Post, Telstra, a body declared not to be an authority, or their subsidiary` `under` `open` `claiming against` `no one yet` `on` (Date 1 1 2026) `transferred back` FALSE))
#ASSERT `I may claim against Comcare` (`with` `asbestosis` `by` `authority` `under` `open` `claiming against` `no one yet` `on` (Date 1 1 2026) `transferred back` FALSE)
#ASSERT `I may claim against Comcare` (`with` `asbestosis` `by` `authority` `under` `a contract of insurance` `claiming against` `no one yet` `on` (Date 1 1 2026) `transferred back` FALSE)
-- s 5(1): a claim made before commencement passes on 26 October 2005.
#ASSERT `the transfer day for` (`with` `asbestosis` `by` `the Commonwealth` `under` `open` `claiming against` `the Commonwealth or the authority` `on` (Date 1 3 2004) `transferred back` FALSE) EQUALS JUST (Date 26 10 2005)
-- s 5(2), (3): a later claim passes when made.
#ASSERT `the transfer day for` (`with` `asbestosis` `by` `the Commonwealth` `under` `open` `claiming against` `Comcare` `on` (Date 2 2 2026) `transferred back` FALSE) EQUALS JUST (Date 2 2 2026)
#ASSERT `who is liable for` (`with` `asbestosis` `by` `the Commonwealth` `under` `open` `claiming against` `Comcare` `on` (Date 2 2 2026) `transferred back` FALSE) EQUALS `Comcare`
#ASSERT `who is liable for` (`with` `asbestosis` `by` `the Commonwealth` `under` `open` `claiming against` `no one yet` `on` (Date 2 2 2026) `transferred back` FALSE) EQUALS `the Commonwealth or the authority, as before`
-- s 6: only an authority's liability can go back.
#ASSERT `who is liable for` (`with` `asbestosis` `by` `authority` `under` `open` `claiming against` `Comcare` `on` (Date 2 2 2026) `transferred back` TRUE) EQUALS `the authority or its successor, after the Minister's declaration`
#ASSERT `who is liable for` (`with` `asbestosis` `by` `the Commonwealth` `under` `open` `claiming against` `Comcare` `on` (Date 2 2 2026) `transferred back` TRUE) EQUALS `Comcare`
-- s 3(1) liability (b)-(c)
#ASSERT `who is liable for` (`with` `asbestosis` `by` `the Commonwealth` `under` `a judgment not stayed or under appeal on 26 October 2005` `claiming against` `the Commonwealth or the authority` `on` (Date 1 3 2004) `transferred back` FALSE) EQUALS `not affected by this Act`
#ASSERT `who is liable for` (`with` `asbestosis` `by` `the Commonwealth` `under` `a written settlement made before 26 October 2005` `claiming against` `the Commonwealth or the authority` `on` (Date 1 3 2004) `transferred back` FALSE) EQUALS `not affected by this Act`
